# Browser client B of the network check: joins, spawns its own box, pushes it the other way and waits for
# the world to settle. It must still be connected when the server prints (server.cmds waits 5200 ticks), however fast the page loads: a client that left earlier is removed from the server's world.
wait 150
assert.net_joined
net.send physics.spawn_box net_b 2 4 0 1
wait 40
net.send physics.push net_b -2 0 0
wait 3800
net.bodies
quit
